## Tab bar behavior (current)

- **Search / Friends / Chat / Calls / Profile:** stay on welcome; `setWelcomeActiveTab(...)` only.
- Friends list UI: welcome `HomeWelcomeFriendsView`; legacy `HomeMenuOverlay` → `HomeFriendsTab.tsx`.

## Next work

Welcome polish / remaining menu migration. **Do not break:** search → `RandomChat`, call lock, crown/profile, friends, chats, calls, existing menu/friends flows.

## Technical notes

- `@react-native-masked-view/masked-view` added; metro no longer stubs MaskedView (tab gradient via mask was reverted — use solid Vi colors on active tabs).
- `WelcomeBrandMark.tsx` may be unused — verify before delete.
- i18n: `frontend/utils/i18n.ts` for welcome/tab strings.
- Chat unread badge: slightly smaller (17px) with count; color darker blue `#2158c0`.
- Chat delete: long-press row → multi-select → trash. Clears for me via `clearChatMessages(peerId, false)`. Android Back exits select.
- Friends welcome: no swipe-delete. Long-press → multi-select → trash removes friends (`removeFriend`). Same chrome as chats select.
- Last-message preview: `getChatMessagesLocal` only (no cache rewrite).
- Calls log: local AsyncStorage (`CALL_LOG_KEY`); outgoing on start, missed via `onMissedIncrement`, incoming on accept (not our outgoing). Phone+plus picks a friend to call. Delete: long-press → multi-select → trash (same as chats).

